## Reported Symptoms

At the beginning of a conversation, an NPC may remain completely motionless.

The actor is not in a T-pose, but appears rigid and inactive.

As the conversation progresses, Open Animation Replacer eventually applies the expected poses correctly.

The issue therefore appears to affect the initial stage of the dialogue or scene.

