## Recommended Procedure If Reproduced

If the same behaviour occurs on NEFARAM-Rhiven:

1. Identify which mod initiated the dialogue or approach.
2. Record the NPC, location and event type.
3. Determine whether the issue occurs:
   - on every approach;
   - only on specific dialogue branches;
   - only in certain cities;
   - only after loading a save;
   - only after another SexLab scene.
4. Check whether OAR eventually applies the correct animation.
5. Check OAR priority and condition logs if available.
6. Test whether the actor returns to normal after dialogue progression.
7. Check Papyrus logs for related errors.
8. Compare behaviour with SLHH and SexLab Approach events separately.

